      "description": "Career Center | Trine University Go to site search Go to main navigation Go to main content Search Go Academics Majors and Degrees Online Programs Dual Enrollment Academic Opportunities Career Preparation Study Abroad Centers Schools Academic Support & Resources Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Libraries Accreditation Become a Student How to Apply Admission Counselors Tuition & Fees Financial Aid & Scholarships Visit Trine Transfer Resources Request Information Admitted Students Lifetime Guarantee Life at Trine Our Campus Campus Map Housing & Res Life Dining Athletics Upcoming Events Clubs & Organizations Music & Performing Arts Student Support Office of Student Affairs Financial Aid International Student Resources Student Support and Wellness Services Safety TrineOnline Info For Parents & Families Current Students Accepted Students Faculty & Staff Alumni & Friends Employers International Students About Trine News Give Athletics Alumni International Apply Visit Request Info Home Career Center Career Center More in this Page Home Contact Career Services Employers Career Events Handshake Complete the Graduate Survey Intern/Co-Op/Experiential Learning Survey Internships and Co-ops Student Resources Resume / Cover Letter Graduate School Personal Statements Career Exploration Job Search Tools Interviewing Networking Professional Image and Etiquette Career Readiness Leadership Development Programs Quinncia - Resume Assistance We strive to educate and empower students while facilitating opportunities to connect\n                                    them with alumni, employers, and friends for advice, experiential learning, and employment\n                                    opportunities. Students work with our team to... Build a resume- Showcase your skills and achievements Review your ATS Friendly resume Find an internship Prepare for a career fair or networking Search for a career Prepare for an interview Evaluate your online brand Evaluate a job offer Plan for graduate school Determine a major career path Get in touch with Trine University Career Center! Tony Booker - Allen School of Engineering and Computing Erin Veysey - Jannen School of Arts and Sciences | Rinker-Ross School of Health Sciences Michelle Young - Franks School of Education | Ketner School of Business The Career Center is located in the Rick L. and Vicki L. James University Center , 1st floor, across from the University Bookstore. Take the Next Steps learn more about trine Visit Request Info cost & affordability Tuition Financial Aid apply Apply Now Contact information for Trine University 260.665.4100 800.347.4878 One University Avenue Angola, IN 46703 Helpful Links Employment Contact Us Maps & Directions Logins MyPortal Moodle Webmail Affiliates TrineOnline Trine Innovation 1 Education One Zollner Golf Course T. Furth Center for Performing Arts Trine Broadcasting Network Copyright © 2026 Trine University. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy Title IX Student Right to Know Social Media Links Twitter Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube SmugMug ©"
